Package: moon-personal
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Moon Personal Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, adduser, systemd | systemd-sysv
Description: private personal companion CLI and daemon
 Moon is a local-first Linux companion CLI for daily messages, period notes,
 hydration reminders, and alarms. The packaged daemon is enabled by default
 as a systemd service and runs continuously in the background.
